          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "To answer what skills you have, pick the three skills the notice asks for that you can prove, give one line of evidence for each and finish with the skill you are building, because a matched and proven short list beats a long list of adjectives."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Say what you are learning next."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Who is asking: The recruiter checks fit with the notice, the manager checks depth and the owner checks whether you will learn quickly."
          }
        ]
